 ],
 "literal": "Forehead pallor having spread, beauty spots having faded, / long soft bamboo-like shoulders having thinned, bangles having slipped, / \"becoming such a woman is because of you,\" thus / if [we] say, what is the use, O friend? Many-striped / snake's hood as it opened like, having closed, / by the east wind ruined, bright red glory lily / upon the rock drooping, to the lord of the land, my / beautiful dark complexion's ruining distress state!",
 "translation": "O friend, what is the use of telling him, \"Her forehead is pale, her beauty spots have faded, her long, soft, bamboo-like shoulders have thinned, and her bangles slip off, and all this is because of you\"? For the lord of the land where the bright red glory lily, ruined by the cold east wind, closes and droops upon the rock like a many-striped snake folding its hood, my beautiful dark complexion is in a state of ruining distress.",
 "modern": "தோழியே! \"நெற்றியில் பசலை படர்ந்து, தேமல் வாடி, நீண்ட மென்மையான மூங்கில் போன்ற தோள்கள் மெலிந்து, வளையல்கள் கழன்று, அவள் இப்படி ஆவதற்குக் காரணம் நீர்தான்\" என்று அவரிடம் சொன்னால் என்ன பயன் விளையும்? பல வரிகளையுடைய பாம்பின் படம் சுருங்குவது போலக் கூம்பி, கொண்டல் காற்றினால் வாடி, மலையின் மேல் கவிழ்ந்து கிடக்கும் ஒளிரும் செங்காந்தள் மலர்களைக் கொண்ட நாட்டை உடையவருக்கு, என்னுடைய அழகிய மாமை நிறம் அழியும்படி நேர்ந்த இந்தத் துன்ப நிலை விளங்குவதில்லையே!",
 "explanation": "The speaker is the heroine talking to her close friend in a Kurinji (mountainous) landscape. The hero has delayed their marriage, causing her immense grief, which manifests as physical wasting (thinning shoulders, slipping bangles) and pallor on her forehead. The friend suggests telling the hero that he is responsible for her suffering, but the heroine despairs, feeling it would be useless. She describes the hero's land using a vivid metaphor: the bright red glory lily, battered by the cold east wind, closes and droops on the rocks, resembling a snake folding its striped hood. This image of the drooping lily reflects her own fading beauty and helpless state, suggesting that the hero, though belonging to a land of such sensitive beauty, remains indifferent to her suffering.",
 "model": "gemini-3.5-flash",
 "generated": "2026-11-27"
}